    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0008:0001",
      "source": "An object conforming to `AVQueuedSampleBufferRendering` keeps track of the occupancy levels of its internal queues for the benefit of clients that enqueue sample buffers from non-real-time sources, for example, clients that can supply sample buffers faster than they are consumed, and so need to decide when to hold back.",
      "ko": "An object conforming to `AVQueuedSampleBufferRendering` keeps track of the occupancy levels of its internal queues for the benefit of clients that enqueue sample buffers from non-real-time sources, for example, clients that can supply sample buffers faster than they are consumed, and so need to decide when to hold back.",
      "sourceHash": "ab467c924782b159728ce2238e6d92876e5bc5a7b883b0e440047f7d7a3657b5",
      "status": "failed"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0008:0002",
      "source": "Clients enqueueing sample buffers from non-real-time sources may hold off from generating or obtaining more sample buffers to enqueue when the value of `readyForMoreMediaData` is `NO`.",
      "ko": "Clients enqueueing sample buffers from non-real-time sources may hold off from generating or obtaining more sample buffers to enqueue when the value of `readyForMoreMediaData` is `NO`.",
      "sourceHash": "2a77189409bf89711a1bad2e350413e5da81b843d8ccedb67a4536020e2fa71a",
      "status": "failed"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0008:0003",
      "source": "It is safe to call [`enqueue(_:)`](avqueuedsamplebufferrendering/enqueue(_:).md) when `readyForMoreMediaData` is `NO`, but don’t enqueue sample buffers without bound.",
      "ko": "It is safe to call [`enqueue(_:)`](avqueuedsamplebufferrendering/enqueue(_:).md) when `readyForMoreMediaData` is `NO`, but don’t enqueue sample buffers without bound.",
      "sourceHash": "dad445e6d9a86375283161629fb77c393d1414b9ea7871d7c5f9ecd231c939a6",
      "status": "failed"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0009:0001",
      "source": "To help with control of the non-real-time supply of sample buffers, clients can call [`requestMediaDataWhenReady(on:using:)`](avqueuedsamplebufferrendering/requestmediadatawhenready(on:using:).md) in order to specify a block that the receiver should invoke whenever it’s ready for sample buffers to be appended.",
      "ko": "To help with control of the non-real-time supply of sample buffers, clients can call [`requestMediaDataWhenReady(on:using:)`](avqueuedsamplebufferrendering/requestmediadatawhenready(on:using:).md) in order to specify a block that the receiver should invoke whenever it’s ready for sample buffers to be appended.",
      "sourceHash": "1e109fcbd331d4a58a8dec8d031f32a0f32463353f8b430e7f6f2da3d37b5615",
      "status": "failed"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0010:0001",
      "source": "The value of `readyForMoreMediaData` often changes` from `NO` to `YES` asynchronously, as previously supplied sample buffers are decoded and rendered.",
      "ko": "이 메서드는 무효화된 세션에서 호출하면 예외를 발생시킵니다.",
      "sourceHash": "fb99bc3aeaebf9d7c479328661e9d21b07e8bb0ba027652d5126bf0f56a1a0e6",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
